GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 8 r 5(3) the serving party must engage a solicitor` MEANS
    IF `documents are to be filed under paragraph (1)`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the duty is "for the purposes of filing the necessary documents under paragraph (1)"

-- src:709 | (3) The serving party must engage a solicitor for the purposes of filing the necessary documents under paragraph (1).
@ref O 8 r 5(3) (src:709)
GIVEN `documents are to be filed under paragraph (1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the serving party has engaged a solicitor` IS A BOOLEAN
