        IF `the undertaking in writing is given to the Ministry of Foreign Affairs` AND `the undertaking in writing is given to the Registrar` AND `the undertaking in writing is given to the serving authority or person in the foreign country`
            THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "must give an undertaking in writing to the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, the Registrar and the serving authority or person in the foreign country"

